an begin="00:06.780" end="00:07.080">Have </span><span begin="00:07.080" end="00:07.290">you </span><span begin="00:07.290" end="00:07.620">ever </span><span begin="00:07.620" end="00:08.010">loved </span><span begin="00:08.010" end="00:08.400">someone </span><span begin="00:08.400" end="00:08.610">so </span><span begin="00:08.610" end="00:09.060">much</span><span begin="00:09.060" end="00:09.060">, </span><span begin="00:09.060" end="00:09.240">you'd </span><span begin="00:09.240" end="00:09.510">give </span><span begin="00:09.510" end="00:09.690">an </span><span begin="00:09.690" end="00:09.900">arm </span><span begin="00:09.900" end="00:10.170">for</span><span begin="00:10.170" end="00:10.230">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.230" end="00:13.440"><span begin="00:10.230" end="00:10.500">Not </span><span begin="00:10.500" end="00:10.680">the </span><span begin="00:10.680" end="00:11.370">expression</span><span begin="00:11.370" end="00:11.430">, </span><span begin="00:11.430" end="00:11.760">no</span><span begin="00:11.760" end="00:11.850">, </span><span begin="00:11.850" end="00:12.420">literally </span><span begin="00:12.420" end="00:12.720">give </span><span begin="00:12.720" end="00:12.870">an </span><span begin="00:12.870" end="00:13.080">arm </span><span begin="00:13.080" end="00:13.410">for</span><span begin="00:13.410" end="00:13.440">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.440" end="00:14.790"><span begin="00:13.440" end="00:13.680">When </span><span begin="00:13.680" end="00:13.830">they </span><span begin="00:13.830" end="00:14.040">know </span><span begin="00:14.040" end="00:14.220">they're </span><span begin="00:14.220" end="00:14.430">your </span><span begin="00:14.430" end="00:14.790">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.880" end="00:16.560"><span begin="00:14.880" end="00:15.090">And </span><span begin="00:15.090" end="00:15.210">you </span><span begin="00:15.210" end="00:15.420">know </span><span begin="00:15.420" end="00:15.