<span begin="00:25.290" end="00:25.440">you </span><span begin="00:25.440" end="00:25.530">to </span><span begin="00:25.530" end="00:25.980">spite </span><span begin="00:25.980" end="00:26.130">you</span><span begin="00:26.130" end="00:26.130">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.130" end="00:29.280"><span begin="00:26.130" end="00:26.460">What </span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.850">happens </span><span begin="00:26.850" end="00:27.060">when </span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.210">you </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.660">become </span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:27.780">the </span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:28.140">main </span><span begin="00:28.140" end="00:28.560">source </span><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:28.680">of </span><span begin="00:28.680" end="00:28.770">her </span><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:29.250">pain</span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.280">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.280" end="00:32.490"><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:29.400">"</span><span begin="00:29.400" end="00:29.820">Daddy </span><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.060">look </span><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.270">what </span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.390">I </span><span begin="00:30.390" end="00:30.810">made</span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:30.840">"</span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:30.840">, </span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.140">Dad's </span><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.410">gotta </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:31.590">go </span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:31.890">catch </span><span begin="00:31.890" end="00:31.980">a </span><span begin="00:31.980" end="00:32.490">plane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.550" end="00:35.760"><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:32.610">"</span><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:33.000">Daddy </span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.270">where's </span><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.720">Mommy</span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:33.870">? </span><span begin="00:33.870" end="00:34.020">I </span><span begin="00:34.020" end="00:34.320">can't </span><span begin="00:34.320" end="00:34.650">find </span><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:35.040">Mommy </span><span begin="00:35.040" end="00:35.400">where </span><span begin="00:35.400" end="00:35.460">is </span><span begin="00:35.460" end="00:35.730">she</span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:35.730">?</span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:35.760">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.880" end="00:38.910"><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.060">I </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.210">don't </span><span begin="00:36.210" end="00:36.420">know </span><span begin="00:36.420" end="00:36.630">go </span><span begin="00:36.630" end="00:37.020">play </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.410">Hailie</span><span begin="00:37.410" end="00:37.410">, </span><span begin="00:37.410" end="00:37.830">baby</span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:37.830">, </span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:37.980">your </span><span begin="00:37.980" end="00:38.460">Daddy's </span><span begin="00:38.460" end="00:38.910">busy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.000" end="00:41.970"><span begin="00:39.000" end="00:39.480">Daddy's </span><span begin="00:39.480" end="00:39.900">writing </span><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:39.990">a </span><span begin="00:39.990" end="00:40.470">song</span><span begin="00:40.470" end="00:40.470">, </span><span begin="00:40.470" end="00:40.590">this </span><span begin="00:40.590" end="00:40.920">song </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.070">ain't </span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.220">gonna </span><span begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.490">write </span><span begin="00:41.490" end="00:41.970">itself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.060" end="00:45.330"><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.240">I'll </span><span begin="00:42.240" end="00:42.480">give </span><span begin="00:42.480" end="00:42.630">you </span><span begin="00:42.6